{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "context": "self_reported", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "7087804776008089601", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56:c001:e001:564b2d0f", "kind": "belief", "locator": "lines 9-17", "metadata_hash": "9dad8c86ed042808954ef0cacb02e5501e76d296fe4e681cb406062fef68318d", "published_at": "2023-07-20T14:45:43.645000Z", "quote": "Rejection is a myth. Consider this: You started without a customer at the beginning of your pitch, and at the end of your sales pitch, you still don’t have a customer.", "source_hash": "6c1613abc4910f7e72c245e90077e1d934d983f8ffaa3853e8b0c5dd29a95458", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_personalgrowth-successtips-careerdevelopment-activity-7087804776008089601-Euz1", "speaker_id": "", "statement": "Rejection is a myth.", "time": "", "title": "Rejection is a myth.", "topic": "self-limiting beliefs", "topic_slug": "self-limiting-beliefs", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56:u000001"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "context": "advised", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "7087804776008089601", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56:c001:e002:9ecec586", "kind": "advice", "locator": "lines 9-17", "metadata_hash": "9dad8c86ed042808954ef0cacb02e5501e76d296fe4e681cb406062fef68318d", "published_at": "2023-07-20T14:45:43.645000Z", "quote": "Instead of perceiving it as a loss, view every opportunity as a chance to gain.", "source_hash": "6c1613abc4910f7e72c245e90077e1d934d983f8ffaa3853e8b0c5dd29a95458", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_personalgrowth-successtips-careerdevelopment-activity-7087804776008089601-Euz1", "speaker_id": "", "statement": "View every opportunity as a chance to gain.", "time": "", "title": "Rejection is a myth.", "topic": "persistence in sales", "topic_slug": "persistence-in-sales", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56:u000001"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "context": "observed", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "7087804776008089601", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56:c001:e003:54d4e7f7", "kind": "fact_claim", "locator": "lines 9-17", "metadata_hash": "9dad8c86ed042808954ef0cacb02e5501e76d296fe4e681cb406062fef68318d", "published_at": "2023-07-20T14:45:43.645000Z", "quote": "High performance, whether in an industry or sport, sets individuals apart from the average performer by their ability to maintain a neutral attitude and perceive rejection as a mere response, NOT as a FAILURE.", "source_hash": "6c1613abc4910f7e72c245e90077e1d934d983f8ffaa3853e8b0c5dd29a95458", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_personalgrowth-successtips-careerdevelopment-activity-7087804776008089601-Euz1", "speaker_id": "", "statement": "High performance sets individuals apart by their ability to maintain a neutral attitude and perceive rejection as a mere response.", "time": "", "title": "Rejection is a myth.", "topic": "teaching approach", "topic_slug": "teaching-approach", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56:u000001"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "context": "advised", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "7087804776008089601", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56:c001:e004:2d19a98a", "kind": "advice", "locator": "lines 19-21", "metadata_hash": "9dad8c86ed042808954ef0cacb02e5501e76d296fe4e681cb406062fef68318d", "published_at": "2023-07-20T14:45:43.645000Z", "quote": "Instead of fixating on positive responses, or the “yes” from clients, shift your focus to the number of attempts you make each day in your prospecting of clients.", "source_hash": "6c1613abc4910f7e72c245e90077e1d934d983f8ffaa3853e8b0c5dd29a95458", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_personalgrowth-successtips-careerdevelopment-activity-7087804776008089601-Euz1", "speaker_id": "", "statement": "Shift focus to the number of attempts you make each day in prospecting.", "time": "", "title": "Rejection is a myth.", "topic": "engagement strategy", "topic_slug": "engagement-strategy", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56:u000002"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "context": "advised", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "7087804776008089601", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56:c001:e005:1f1872ea", "kind": "case_study", "locator": "lines 19-21", "metadata_hash": "9dad8c86ed042808954ef0cacb02e5501e76d296fe4e681cb406062fef68318d", "published_at": "2023-07-20T14:45:43.645000Z", "quote": "As a real estate agent, a good number is between 15 to 20 conversations a day with new clients.", "source_hash": "6c1613abc4910f7e72c245e90077e1d934d983f8ffaa3853e8b0c5dd29a95458", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_personalgrowth-successtips-careerdevelopment-activity-7087804776008089601-Euz1", "speaker_id": "", "statement": "A good number for a real estate agent is between 15 to 20 conversations a day with new clients.", "time": "", "title": "Rejection is a myth.", "topic": "goals in sales", "topic_slug": "goals-in-sales", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2023-07-20-rejection-is-a-myth-consider-md-c6d7a21b56:u000002"}
